{
 "title": "Wars",
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "Wars",
   "card": false,
   "beats": [
    {
     "id": "c390",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In the 1950s, border raids by Palestinians",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c391",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and Israeli reprisals turn into a cycle.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c392",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1956, Israel joins Britain and France",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c393",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "in attacking Egypt over the Suez Canal",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c394",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and is pressured to withdraw.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c395",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "By 1967, tension peaks.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c396",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Egypt's president, Nasser,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c397",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "expels United Nations peacekeepers from Sinai,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c398",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "moves troops to the border",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c399",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and closes the Straits of Tiran to Israeli ships.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c400",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel calls that an act of war.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c401",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "On June 5th, Israel strikes first,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c402",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "destroying most of Egypt's air force on the ground",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c403",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "within hours.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c404",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In six days, Israel takes the Sinai and Gaza",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c405",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from Egypt, the West Bank and East Jerusalem",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c406",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from Jordan and the Golan Heights from Syria.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c407",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israeli soldiers weep at the Western Wall,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c408",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "which Jews had not been able to reach since 48.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c409",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "For many Jews, it feels like a miracle.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c410",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "For the million Palestinians",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c411",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "now under Israeli military control,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c412",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "it is the start of an occupation",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c413",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "that has lasted ever since.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c414",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel annexes East Jerusalem",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c415",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and offers its Palestinian residents residency,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c416",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "not citizenship, which most of the world does not recognize.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c417",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And Israelis still argue among themselves",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c418",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "about whether 67 was a war of necessity or a war of choice.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c419",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "The Arab League answers at Khartoum",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c420",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "with the famous three noes: no peace, no recognition,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c421",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "no negotiation with Israel.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c422",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel begins building settlements in the occupied land.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c423",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Most countries consider them illegal",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c424",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "under international law.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c425",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israeli governments dispute that. Through the early 70s,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c426",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Palestinian groups led by the PLO",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c427",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "carry out hijackings and attacks abroad.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c428",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "At the 1972 Olympics in Munich,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c429",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "gunmen kill 11 Israeli athletes and coaches.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c430",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Then on October 6th, 1973,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c431",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Yom Kippur, the holiest day in the Jewish calendar,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c432",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Egypt and Syria attacked by surprise.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c433",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "For a few days, Israel reels",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c434",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and about 2,600 of its soldiers died",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c435",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "before it turns the tide.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c436",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1976, Israeli commandos fly 4,000 kilometers",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c437",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "to Entebbe, Uganda, and rescue more than 100 hostages",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c438",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "from a hijacked plane.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c439",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the shock of 73 shatters Israel's confidence",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c440",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "and it changes something in Egypt's president,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c441",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Anwar Sadat.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c442",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1977, he does what no Arab leader has done.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c443",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "He flies to Jerusalem and speaks to the Israeli parliament.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c444",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "In 1979, after talks at Camp David,",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c445",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Egypt and Israel sign a peace treaty.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c446",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Israel returns the Sinai, Egypt recognizes Israel.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c447",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Sadat is assassinated by Islamist soldiers two years later.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c448",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "But the peace holds to this day.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c449",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "And it proves that land can be traded for peace.",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c450",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "Whether that could work with the Palestinians",
     "date": null
    },
    {
     "id": "c451",
     "shot": "g_wars",
     "type": "HOST",
     "text": "is the question that dominates the next 40 years.",
     "date": null
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}